{"id":362,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"共生と文武両道で学ぶ東海中高一貫","feature_description":"東海中学校・東海高等学校は、『自然・生命・人間』の理念のもと、基礎学力を土台に共生の精神と文武両道を育てる学校です。現代文明論や各教科の学びに加え、部活動も幅広く、学習と活動の両立を通じて自立した東海生をめざします。また、中高一貫の幅広い部活動が、仲間と切磋琢磨する場になっています。学問と課外活動の両方を高い熱量で深められる点も特徴です。","clubs":[{"id":6645,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6646,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6647,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6648,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6649,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6650,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6651,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6652,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6653,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6654,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6655,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6656,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6657,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokai-jh.ed.jp/life/02.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6658,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","sou